  "solution": {
    "text": "Given, the area of the triangle with vertices <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;sq. units&nbsp;<p>Now applying formula for area we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p>Now given points will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>64</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>OR&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>64</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Given above points are collinear, so their slope will be equal, so&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>slope=</mtext><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>64</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>64</mn></math></p>"
  }
